[Info]
Name	Old Enemies
Description	One rival keeper, and a vault of heroes between you that hates you both the same. Skirmish, 1 opponent plus heroes. A hero company holds a walled keep in the wilds; storm them for their gold, or leave them be and fight whatever they send out.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
[/Info]

